**Summary of the fix:**  
- The patch removes the logic that tries to add parentheses when comments are present between the arrow and the body, which was the root cause of the bug.  
- Now, if comments are present, the autofixer will only move the body beside the arrow and insert the comments, avoiding the invalid code generation.

This should prevent the autofixer from generating thousands of closing parentheses and breaking the code.
